      {
        "id": 40333,
        "name": "Koga",
        "username": "Koga",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/koga/{size}/2058_2.png",
        "created_at": "2012-10-31T03:59:00.000Z",
        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"lugaru\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/lugaru/48/2767_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> lugaru:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>Nice… I might try fooling with this officially after the next release… I will need to log into my old Champions Online account to get some good art to use tho. <img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/slightly_smiling_face.png?v=12\" title=\":slightly_smiling_face:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":slightly_smiling_face:\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"></p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>CO is a great place to get art for the cards, did it with my first custom hero and working on my second one. Made sure to do it in a variety of environments and different enemies. Took like 200+ screenshots to make sure I got things right.</p>\n<p>Was eaiser on my first guy, he was already lvl 40, second one I had to start from scratch, but it got me in the game again. I have a lifetime sub so I come and go whenever&nbsp;I please.</p>",
