        "id": 40334,
        "name": "faust",
        "username": "faust",
        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/f/c89c15/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2012-10-31T16:53:49.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>&nbsp;</p><h2>Version 0.5</h2><p>Features:</p><ul>\n<li>Environment Deck and Environment Cards added</li>\n<li>Right clicking implemented on deck screens and tabs</li>\n<li>Deck Statistics implemented in deck manager</li>\n</ul><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Bug Fixes:</p><ul>\n<li>Removed Deck statistics link from deck menu</li>\n<li>Portrait button missing on Hero Front Card fixed</li>\n<li>Needs more memory than default java heap size so deployed with batch file and packaged as exe</li>\n<li>Export deck to pages now takes number in deck into account</li>\n</ul><p>&nbsp;</p><p><a href=\"http://github.com/fostorial/Forge-of-the-Multiverse/downloads\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">http://github.com/fostorial/Forge-of-the-Multiverse/downloads</a></p><p>Available now! I have exported each type of deck and it appears to work fine. It's also packaged with an exe file so windows users please that as it sets up memory settings properly.</p>",
