        "created_at": "2012-11-13T04:32:41.000Z",
        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"lugaru\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/lugaru/48/2767_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> lugaru:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>Nice, at this point all I'm looking for is a custom Villain card… right now I have screenshots and did the front and back for a new Voss but I dont have a card to put his front and back rules on. Also (and Koga should consider this too) an Oversized Villain card template would rock… something with 2 layers so you can have a full body image that is half obscured by the rules and advanced edition info.</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>I'll get working on an oversized villain&nbsp;template soon. My own custom villain seems decently balanced so far so would be nice to have an oversized card for him.</p>",
