        "created_at": "2012-11-15T16:02:09.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>So I did a quick big villain template this morning, and I'm very happy with the way it came out.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Here is how it works...</p><p>Text (select layer, replace text with anything else, font is set up)</p><p>Solid colored text boxes (fill with another color as needed)</p><p>Black Frame</p><p>Image you want to use</p><p>Background</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Watcha think? These are PNG previews. I will post some villains early next week.</p><p>![](upload://hsvqXFuCcsJSOSZxYrf7YEEg99J.png)![](upload://7aPVsiTfw1HBOCZMY3PGk9FsN6v.png)</p>",
