        "created_at": "2012-12-02T10:27:28.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>thanks! i look forward to it. it's been a lot of fun playing around with it. i've been using it in conjunction with word and gimp to make an entire Villain deck that i'll be posting soon. i'll link here when it's finished.</p><p>a couple of other notes on FOTM:</p><p>it would be nice to be able to export single cards instead of the entire deck of cards, for when you make an adjustment to just one card, but don't want to overwrite the other files you have previiously exported.</p><p>and another style/color fix: a black border around the \"class\" box. easy enough to add in GIMP.</p>",
